<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>You Have Been Invited to Trendupp Admin Portal</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f6f8; margin: 0; padding: 20px; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #d81b60; color: #ffffff; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
    .content { padding: 30px 25px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .btn-container { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }
    .btn { background-color: #d81b60; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; display: inline-block; }
    .code-box { background: #fce4ec; border: 1px dashed #d81b60; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #d81b60; }
    .footer { background: #fafafa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to Trendupp Admin Portal</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello <strong><%= adminName %></strong>,</p>
      <p>You have been invited to join the Trendupp Admin Portal as a <strong><%= roleName %></strong>.</p>
      <p>Click the button below to accept your invitation and set up your account password:</p>

      <div class="btn-container">
        <a href="<%= inviteUrl %>" class="btn">Set Up Account Password</a>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #666;">Or copy and paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="<%= inviteUrl %>" style="color: #d81b60; word-break: break-all;"><%= inviteUrl %></a></p>

      <div class="code-box">
        Activation Code: <%= activationCode %>
      </div>

      <p>If you did not request this invitation, please contact system security immediately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Trendupp Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
